This collection began with the 262 SVGs maintained in hashimkarim/usagestat-bar.
provenance.json records that source revision and the original file hashes.
Its history credits LobeHub lobe-icons and steipete/CodexBar alongside local
UsageStat-Bar additions. Their MIT notices are retained in licenses/.

The collection also includes the complete static SVG catalogue from
https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-icons. sources/lobehub.json records the pinned
upstream revision and catalogue; provenance.json's lobehub section records
SHA-256 hashes of imported assets. Original local artwork is preserved when
filenames overlap. LobeHub's MIT notice is retained in licenses/LobeHub-MIT.txt.

Names and logos are trademarks of their respective owners. The library does
not imply endorsement or transfer trademark rights. Product alternatives and
aliases select artwork only; they do not select a runtime, account or billing.

The generated inline module removes layout styles, accessibility labels and
titles and namespaces SVG fragment identifiers. A strict allowlist retains
rendering styles needed for masks, blending, grayscale and stroke width.
Original SVG files remain unchanged. Consumers supply their own accessible
label or mark icons decorative.
